0..66 Comment "//! `suspended` resumes an access that holds a view of a variable."
67..70 Comment "//!"
71..147 Comment "//! The reified stack retains the view outside its source frame. The checker"
148..200 Comment "//! reports `ViewEscaped` for the `dangling` source."
201..275 Comment "//! A suspended computation reaches its locals in the window of its frame,"
276..312 Comment "//! never by an address into itself."
313..316 Comment "//!"
317..370 Comment "//! The source imports the host early exit interface."
371..433 Comment "//! The handler resumes after `exit`. The source runs to `12`."
434..437 Comment "//!"
438..500 Comment "//! Rust uses `Pin` from RFC 2349 for a self-borrowing future."
501..553 Comment "//! C++ keeps such an object immobile by convention."
554..586 Comment "//! - see: #1183 — `suspended`"
